# Nail — English texts of the window manager (M5c WP171): window frames,
# title bars, maximize / restore, snapping, resize handles, keyboard move /
# resize, focus and z-order (message ids `window-manager-*`). Texts named by
# the contract (snapped halves, window-state issues) are in
# core-windows.ftl.

## Title bar

window-manager-title-bar = Title bar of { $title }
window-manager-maximize = Maximize
window-manager-restore = Restore
window-manager-hint = Arrow keys move the window, Shift+arrow keys resize it. Double-click the title bar to maximize it.
window-manager-hint-fixed = Arrow keys move the window.

## Announcements

window-manager-maximized = Window maximized
window-manager-restored = Window restored
window-manager-moving = Moving the window: arrow keys move it, Enter keeps the new place, Escape goes back.
window-manager-sizing = Resizing the window: arrow keys change its size, Enter keeps it, Escape goes back.

## Actions (command palette, key bindings)

window-manager-action-cycle = Next window
window-manager-action-cycle-keywords = switch window focus ctrl f6
window-manager-action-main = Back to the main window
window-manager-action-main-keywords = switch window focus main
window-manager-action-maximize = Maximize or restore window
window-manager-action-maximize-keywords = full size window restore
window-manager-action-reset = Reset window positions
window-manager-action-reset-keywords = window size position default forget
